---
// Phase 0 homepage.
//
// UX_FLOWS.md §2 specifies this page as "the board" — 8 opportunity rows,
// soonest deadline first, server-rendered above the fold. That needs the
// `opportunities` table, which lands in Phase 1. Until then this page says
// plainly what the product is and that the catalogue is still being built.
//
// It deliberately shows NO counts. CONTENT_AND_LAUNCH.md §1: every number shown
// is true and computed live. With nothing published yet, the honest number is
// no number — not "0 opportunities", and certainly not a placeholder.
//
// Deliberately absent, per §2: hero image, illustration, gradient, animated
// statistic, testimonials, fabricated community numbers.

import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { BRAND } from "@mbele/config";
---

<Base
  title={BRAND.name}
  description="Find opportunities open to your country, and know whether you can apply before you spend the data finding out."
>
  <h1 class="max-w-[28ch] text-display font-bold leading-[--text-display--line-height]">
    Everything here is open, and we tell you whether you can apply.
  </h1>

  <p class="prose-measure mt-4 text-body text-ink-2">
    Hackathons, grants, fellowships and scholarships open to builders across all
    54 African countries. Every listing shows when we last checked it, and every
    eligibility answer shows the sentence from the official rules it came from.
  </p>

  <section class="mt-8 border border-line bg-surface p-4" aria-labelledby="status">
    <h2 id="status" class="text-subtitle font-semibold">The catalogue is being built</h2>
    <p class="prose-measure mt-2 text-dense text-ink-2">
      There is nothing published yet, so there is nothing to show you. We would
      rather say that than pad this page with a number we cannot stand behind.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="mt-8" aria-labelledby="what">
    <h2 id="what" class="text-subtitle font-semibold">What this will answer</h2>
    <ul class="prose-measure mt-3 space-y-3 text-dense">
      <li class="border-l-2 border-line pl-3">
        <strong class="font-semibold">Is it open?</strong> Every record carries the
        date we last verified it. Stale listings are labelled, not quietly served.
      </li>
      <li class="border-l-2 border-line pl-3">
        <strong class="font-semibold">Can I apply?</strong> A verdict for your
        country, age and study status — with the quoted sentence behind every
        part of it, and an honest <em>unclear</em> when the rules do not say.
      </li>
      <li class="border-l-2 border-line pl-3">
        <strong class="font-semibold">What is actually required?</strong> The
        deliverables, judging criteria and key dates, pulled out of the rules
        document so you do not have to download it.
      </li>
      <li class="border-l-2 border-line pl-3">
        <strong class="font-semibold">Who else is going for it?</strong> Only once
        enough people actually are. No empty rooms.
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</Base>
